<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="th">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>ภารกิจพิชิตสมรรถภาพทางกาย - FITNESS CHALLENGE</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Kanit:wght@300;400;600;700;800&family=Prompt:wght@400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/canvas-confetti@1.6.0/dist/confetti.browser.min.js"></script>

    <script>
        tailwind.config = {
            theme: {
                extend: {
                    fontFamily: {
                        kanit: ['Kanit', 'sans-serif'],
                        prompt: ['Prompt', 'sans-serif'],
                    },
                    colors: {
                        brand: {
                            orange: '#FF5722',
                            cyan: '#00BCD4',
                            emerald: '#10B981',
                            gold: '#F59E0B',
                            purple: '#8B5CF6',
                            dark: '#0F172A',
                            accent: '#EC4899'
                        }
                    },
                    animation: {
                        'bounce-short': 'bounce 0.5s ease-in-out 2',
                        'pulse-fast': 'pulse 1s infinite',
                        'spin-slow': 'spin 8s linear infinite',
                    }
                }
            }
        }
    </script>

    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Kanit', sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f172a 0%, #1e1b4b 50%, #111827 100%);
            color: #f8fafc;
            min-height: 100vh;
            user-select: none;
        }

        .glass-panel {
            background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.75);
            backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
        }

        .glass-card {
            background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.85);
            backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
        }

        ::-webkit-scrollbar {
            width: 6px;
            height: 6px;
        }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-track {
            background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.6);
        }
        ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
            background: #3b82f6;
            border-radius: 4px;
        }

        /* 3D Interactive Dice */
        .dice-container {
            perspective: 1000px;
        }
        .dice {
            width: 70px;
            height: 70px;
            position: relative;
            transform-style: preserve-3d;
            transition: transform 1s ease-out;
            cursor: pointer;
        }
        .dice-face {
            position: absolute;
            width: 70px;
            height: 70px;
            background: linear-gradient(145deg, #ffffff, #e2e8f0);
            border: 2px solid #94a3b8;
            border-radius: 14px;
            box-shadow: inset 0 0 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.1), 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            grid-template-rows: repeat(3, 1fr);
            padding: 8px;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        .dot {
            background-color: #1e293b;
            border-radius: 50%;
            align-self: center;
            justify-self: center;
            width: 11px;
            height: 11px;
            box-shadow: inset 0 2px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
        }
        .dot.red { background-color: #ef4444; }

        .face-1 { transform: translateZ(35px); }
        .face-2 { transform: rotateY(180deg) translateZ(35px); }
        .face-3 { transform: rotateY(-90deg) translateZ(35px); }
        .face-4 { transform: rotateY(90deg) translateZ(35px); }
        .face-5 { transform: rotateX(90deg) translateZ(35px); }
        .face-6 { transform: rotateX(-90deg) translateZ(35px); }

        .player-pawn {
            transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1);
            filter: drop-shadow(0px 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6));
        }

        .tile-active {
            box-shadow: 0 0 15px #3b82f6, inset 0 0 10px #60a5fa;
            border-color: #93c5fd !important;
        }

        .glow-btn {
            box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.5);
        }
        .glow-btn:hover {
            box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.8);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="flex flex-col min-h-screen justify-between overflow-x-hidden">

    <header class="glass-panel sticky top-0 z-30 px-4 py-3 flex justify-between items-center shadow-lg border-b border-slate-700/50">
        <div class="flex items-center space-x-3">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-tr from-orange-500 to-amber-400 flex items-center justify-center text-white text-xl shadow-md">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-trophy"></i>
            </div>
            <div>
                <h1 class="font-bold text-lg md:text-xl text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-orange-400 via-amber-300 to-cyan-400 leading-tight">
                    ภารกิจพิชิตสมรรถภาพทางกาย
                </h1>
                <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 font-prompt tracking-wide">FITNESS CHALLENGE • สื่อการเรียนรู้พลศึกษา ม.1–ม.3</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex items-center space-x-2 md:space-x-3">
            <button id="btnSoundToggle" onclick="toggleSound()" class="p-2.5 rounded-xl glass-card hover:bg-slate-700 text-slate-300 transition" title="เปิด/ปิด เสียง">
                <i id="soundIcon" class="fa-solid fa-volume-high"></i>
            </button>
            <button onclick="openModal('manualModal')" class="px-3 py-2 text-xs md:text-sm font-semibold rounded-xl bg-cyan-600 hover:bg-cyan-500 text-white transition flex items-center gap-2 shadow">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-book-open"></i> <span class="hidden md:inline">คู่มือการเล่น</span>
            </button>
            <button onclick="openModal('knowledgeModal')" class="px-3 py-2 text-xs md:text-sm font-semibold rounded-xl bg-purple-600 hover:bg-purple-500 text-white transition flex items-center gap-2 shadow">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-graduation-cap"></i> <span class="hidden md:inline">คลังความรู้</span>
            </button>
            <button onclick="confirmReset()" class="px-3 py-2 text-xs md:text-sm font-semibold rounded-xl bg-rose-600 hover:bg-rose-500 text-white transition flex items-center gap-1.5 shadow">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-rotate-left"></i> <span class="hidden sm:inline">เริ่มใหม่</span>
            </button>
        </div>
    </header>

    <main class="flex-grow p-2 md:p-6 max-w-7xl mx-auto w-full grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-6 items-start">
        
        <!-- BOARD CONTAINER (8 COLS) -->
        <section class="lg:col-span-8 flex flex-col items-center">
            
            <!-- Turn & Game Info Header -->
            <div class="w-full glass-panel rounded-2xl p-4 mb-4 flex flex-wrap justify-between items-center gap-3 border border-slate-700/60 shadow-lg">
                <div class="flex items-center space-x-3">
                    <div id="turnBadge" class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center text-2xl shadow-inner border-2 border-white/20 transition-all">
                        ⚽
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <div class="text-xs text-slate-400 font-prompt">ตาของผู้เล่นปัจจุบัน</div>
                        <div id="turnPlayerName" class="font-bold text-lg text-amber-300">กำลังเตรียมเกม...</div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
                    <div class="text-right">
                        <span class="text-xs text-slate-400 font-prompt block">รอบการเล่น</span>
                        <span id="roundCounter" class="text-lg font-bold text-cyan-400">รอบที่ 1</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="h-8 w-px bg-slate-700"></div>
                    <div class="text-right">
                        <span class="text-xs text-slate-400 font-prompt block">ผู้นำคะแนน</span>
                        <span id="leaderName" class="text-lg font-bold text-emerald-400">-</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- BOARD CONTAINER GRAPHIC -->
            <div class="w-full glass-panel rounded-3xl p-3 md:p-5 relative shadow-2xl overflow-hidden border border-slate-700/80">
                <div id="boardGrid" class="grid grid-cols-6 sm:grid-cols-8 md:grid-cols-11 gap-1.5 md:gap-2.5 relative min-h-[480px] md:min-h-[560px]">
                    
                    <div class="absolute inset-[12%] sm:inset-[13%] md:inset-[12%] glass-card rounded-2xl z-10 flex flex-col items-center justify-between p-4 md:p-6 border border-slate-600/50 shadow-2xl bg-slate-900/90 text-center">
                        
                        <div class="space-y-1">
                            <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider bg-gradient-to-r from-orange-500 to-amber-500 text-slate-950 shadow">
                                ARENA CENTER
                            </span>
                            <h2 class="text-lg md:text-2xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-wide">ลานกิจกรรมท้าทาย</h2>
                        </div>

                        <!-- 3D Interactive Dice -->
                        <div class="flex flex-col items-center my-2">
                            <div class="dice-container my-2" onclick="rollDice()">
                                <div id="dice" class="dice">
                                    <div class="dice-face face-1"><span class="dot red font-bold" style="grid-area:2/2"></span></div>
                                    <div class="dice-face face-2"><span class="dot" style="grid-area:1/1"></span><span class="dot" style="grid-area:3/3"></span></div>
                                    <div class="dice-face face-3"><span class="dot" style="grid-area:1/1"></span><span class="dot" style="grid-area:2/2"></span><span class="dot" style="grid-area:3/3"></span></div>
                                    <div class="dice-face face-4"><span class="dot" style="grid-area:1/1"></span><span class="dot" style="grid-area:1/3"></span><span class="dot" style="grid-area:3/1"></span><span class="dot" style="grid-area:3/3"></span></div>
                                    <div class="dice-face face-5"><span class="dot" style="grid-area:1/1"></span><span class="dot" style="grid-area:1/3"></span><span class="dot" style="grid-area:2/2"></span><span class="dot" style="grid-area:3/1"></span><span class="dot" style="grid-area:3/3"></span></div>
                                    <div class="dice-face face-6"><span class="dot" style="grid-area:1/1"></span><span class="dot" style="grid-area:1/3"></span><span class="dot" style="grid-area:2/1"></span><span class="dot" style="grid-area:2/3"></span><span class="dot" style="grid-area:3/1"></span><span class="dot" style="grid-area:3/3"></span></div>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <button id="btnRollDice" onclick="rollDice()" class="mt-3 px-6 py-2.5 rounded-xl font-extrabold text-sm md:text-base bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 via-orange-500 to-rose-500 hover:from-amber-400 hover:to-rose-400 text-slate-950 transition-all transform hover:scale-105 active:scale-95 glow-btn flex items-center gap-2">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-dice text-lg"></i> ทอยลูกเต๋า
                            </button>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Live Action Feed -->
                        <div id="gameLog" class="w-full bg-slate-950/70 border border-slate-800 rounded-xl p-2.5 text-xs text-slate-300 max-h-20 overflow-y-auto text-left font-prompt leading-relaxed shadow-inner">
                            <p class="text-amber-400 font-semibold"><i class="fa-solid fa-bell text-xs mr-1"></i> ยินดีต้อนรับสู่เกมภารกิจพิชิตสมรรถภาพทางกาย!</p>
                            <p class="text-slate-400">กดปุ่ม "ทอยลูกเต๋า" เพื่อเริ่มการผจญภัย</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Legend Bar -->
            <div class="w-full glass-panel rounded-2xl p-3 mt-4 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-around gap-2 text-xs font-prompt text-slate-300">
                <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-cyan-500"></span> ❓ คำถาม (+2)</span>
                <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span> 🏃 ภารกิจ (+3)</span>
                <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-amber-500"></span> 💪 ทดสอบ (+3)</span>
                <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-purple-500"></span> ⭐ โบนัส (+1~3)</span>
                <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-rose-500"></span> 🔥 FITNESS (+5)</span>
                <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-indigo-500"></span> ⚡ SUPER SPORT</span>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="lg:col-span-4 space-y-4">
            
            <div class="glass-panel rounded-3xl p-5 border border-slate-700/70 shadow-xl">
                <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-4 pb-2 border-b border-slate-700">
                    <h3 class="font-bold text-lg text-white flex items-center gap-2">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-ranking-star text-amber-400"></i> ตารางคะแนนผู้เล่น
                    </h3>
                    <span id="playerCountBadge" class="text-xs bg-slate-800 text-slate-300 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg">
                        0 คน
                    </span>
                </div>

                <div id="playersList" class="space-y-3 max-h-[460px] overflow-y-auto pr-1">
                    <!-- Dynamic player rows -->
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="glass-panel rounded-3xl p-4 border border-slate-700/60 bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-900/90 to-indigo-950/40">
                <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
                    <div class="p-2.5 bg-cyan-500/20 text-cyan-400 rounded-xl">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-lightbulb text-xl"></i>
                    </div>
                    <div class="text-xs space-y-1">
                        <h4 class="font-bold text-sm text-cyan-300">เคล็ดลับการเรียนรู้พลศึกษา</h4>
                        <p class="text-slate-300 font-prompt leading-relaxed">
                            หลักการออกกำลังกาย <strong class="text-amber-300">FITT</strong> ประกอบด้วย: <br>
                            <strong>F</strong>requency (ความถี่), <strong>I</strong>ntensity (ความหนัก), <br>
                            <strong>T</strong>ime (เวลา) และ <strong>T</strong>ype (ชนิดการออกกำลังกาย)
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

        </section>

    </main>

    <div id="setupModal" class="fixed inset-0 bg-slate-950/85 backdrop-blur-md z-50 flex items-center justify-center p-4">
        <div class="glass-card max-w-xl w-full rounded-3xl p-6 md:p-8 border border-slate-700 shadow-2xl relative">
            
            <div class="text-center space-y-2 mb-6">
                <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-gradient-to-tr from-orange-500 to-amber-400 rounded-2xl mx-auto flex items-center justify-center text-3xl shadow-lg text-slate-950 mb-2">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-gamepad"></i>
                </div>
                <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-extrabold text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-orange-400 via-amber-300 to-cyan-300">
                    เตรียมความพร้อมการเล่น
                </h2>
                <p class="text-xs md:text-sm text-slate-300 font-prompt">
                    ตั้งค่าจำนวนผู้เล่นและเลือกตัวเดินอุปกรณ์กีฬา (2–6 คน)
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="mb-6">
                <label class="block text-sm font-semibold text-slate-300 mb-2 font-prompt">จำนวนผู้เล่น</label>
                <div class="grid grid-cols-5 gap-2" id="numPlayersSelector">
                    <button type="button" onclick="setPlayerCount(2)" class="player-cnt-btn py-2.5 rounded-xl font-bold bg-slate-800 hover:bg-cyan-600 text-white transition border border-slate-700">2 คน</button>
                    <button type="button" onclick="setPlayerCount(3)" class="player-cnt-btn py-2.5 rounded-xl font-bold bg-cyan-600 text-white border border-cyan-400 transition">3 คน</button>
                    <button type="button" onclick="setPlayerCount(4)" class="player-cnt-btn py-2.5 rounded-xl font-bold bg-slate-800 hover:bg-cyan-600 text-white transition border border-slate-700">4 คน</button>
                    <button type="button" onclick="setPlayerCount(5)" class="player-cnt-btn py-2.5 rounded-xl font-bold bg-slate-800 hover:bg-cyan-600 text-white transition border border-slate-700">5 คน</button>
                    <button type="button" onclick="setPlayerCount(6)" class="player-cnt-btn py-2.5 rounded-xl font-bold bg-slate-800 hover:bg-cyan-600 text-white transition border border-slate-700">6 คน</button>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div id="playerInputsContainer" class="space-y-3 max-h-60 overflow-y-auto pr-2 mb-6">
                <!-- Dynamic forms -->
            </div>

            <button onclick="startGame()" class="w-full py-3.5 rounded-2xl font-extrabold text-lg bg-gradient-to-r from-orange-500 via-amber-500 to-emerald-500 hover:from-orange-400 hover:to-emerald-400 text-slate-950 shadow-xl transition transform active:scale-95 flex items-center justify-center gap-2">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-play"></i> เริ่มการผจญภัยภารกิจ!
            </button>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div id="questionModal" class="fixed inset-0 bg-slate-950/80 backdrop-blur-md z-50 hidden flex items-center justify-center p-4">
        <div class="glass-card max-w-lg w-full rounded-3xl p-6 border border-cyan-500/40 shadow-2xl relative">
            <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-4">
                <span class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-bold bg-cyan-500/20 text-cyan-300 border border-cyan-500/30">
                    ❓ การ์ดคำถามความรู้พลศึกษา (+2 คะแนน)
                </span>
                <span id="questionTopic" class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-400 font-prompt">หมวด: สมรรถภาพทางกาย</span>
            </div>

            <h3 id="questionText" class="text-base md:text-lg font-bold text-white mb-5 leading-relaxed">
                คำถามจะแสดงที่นี่...
            </h3>

            <div id="questionOptions" class="space-y-2.5 mb-5">
                <!-- Options -->
            </div>

            <div id="questionFeedback" class="hidden p-3 rounded-xl text-xs md:text-sm font-prompt leading-relaxed mb-4"></div>

            <button id="btnConfirmQuestion" onclick="closeQuestionModal()" class="hidden w-full py-2.5 rounded-xl font-bold bg-cyan-600 hover:bg-cyan-500 text-white transition">
                รับทราบ / ตกลง
            </button>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div id="missionModal" class="fixed inset-0 bg-slate-950/80 backdrop-blur-md z-50 hidden flex items-center justify-center p-4">
        <div class="glass-card max-w-lg w-full rounded-3xl p-6 border border-emerald-500/40 shadow-2xl relative text-center">
            <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-400 rounded-2xl mx-auto flex items-center justify-center text-3xl mb-3 border border-emerald-500/30">
                <i id="missionIcon" class="fa-solid fa-person-running"></i>
            </div>
            
            <span id="missionBadge" class="px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-bold bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-300 border border-emerald-500/30">
                🏃 ภารกิจท้าทายกายภาพ (+3 คะแนน)
            </span>

            <h3 id="missionTitle" class="text-xl font-extrabold text-white my-3">
                ชื่อภารกิจ
            </h3>
            
            <p id="missionDesc" class="text-sm text-slate-200 font-prompt mb-4 leading-relaxed bg-slate-900/60 p-4 rounded-2xl border border-slate-800">
                คำอธิบายภารกิจทางกายภาพที่ปลอดภัย...
            </p>

            <div id="timerContainer" class="mb-5 hidden">
                <div class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-amber-400 font-mono" id="missionTimer">15</div>
                <div class="text-xs text-slate-400 font-prompt">วินาทีในการปฏิบัติ</div>
            </div>

            <div class="flex gap-3 justify-center">
                <button id="btnStartTimer" onclick="startMissionTimer()" class="px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl font-bold bg-amber-500 hover:bg-amber-400 text-slate-950 transition flex items-center gap-2">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-stopwatch"></i> เริ่มจับเวลา
                </button>
                <button onclick="completeMission(true)" class="px-6 py-2.5 rounded-xl font-bold bg-emerald-500 hover:bg-emerald-400 text-slate-950 transition flex items-center gap-2">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i> ทำสำเร็จแล้ว
                </button>
                <button onclick="completeMission(false)" class="px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl font-bold bg-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-600 text-slate-300 transition">
                    ข้าม
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div id="bonusModal" class="fixed inset-0 bg-slate-950/80 backdrop-blur-md z-50 hidden flex items-center justify-center p-4">
        <div class="glass-card max-w-md w-full rounded-3xl p-6 border border-amber-500/40 shadow-2xl text-center">
            <div id="bonusIconBox" class="w-16 h-16 bg-amber-500/20 text-amber-400 rounded-2xl mx-auto flex items-center justify-center text-3xl mb-3 border border-amber-500/30">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i>
            </div>
            
            <h3 id="bonusTitle" class="text-xl font-extrabold text-amber-300 mb-2">ช่องโบนัสพิเศษ!</h3>
            <p id="bonusMessage" class="text-sm text-slate-200 font-prompt mb-6 leading-relaxed">คุณได้รับคะแนนพิเศษเพิ่มเติม!</p>

            <button onclick="closeBonusModal()" class="w-full py-3 rounded-xl font-bold bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-orange-500 hover:from-amber-400 hover:to-orange-400 text-slate-950 transition">
                ยอดเยี่ยม!
            </button>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div id="manualModal" class="fixed inset-0 bg-slate-950/85 backdrop-blur-md z-50 hidden flex items-center justify-center p-4">
        <div class="glass-card max-w-2xl w-full rounded-3xl p-6 border border-slate-700 shadow-2xl max-h-[85vh] flex flex-col">
            <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-4 pb-2 border-b border-slate-700">
